  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.431 Lake Monomonac",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.431 Lake Monomonac. That part of Lake Monomonac in the town of Rindge on the northwest of a passageway, 150 feet from Beauvais Point and the Santa Maria and 150 feet from the three islands owned by Camp Starfish and extending south to the Massachusetts border shall be a “no wake” area.\n\nSource. #13200, EXEMPT, eff 5-6-21",
